    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The contrarian “Accuracy is the wrong question” headline, evaluation-ledger framing, cyan/red signal palette, and dense forensic typography create a recognizable defense-lab identity across viewports. However, the core experience remains a conventional stack of KPI cards, standard charts, matrix, and table; there is no singular visual mechanism or dramatic data story that makes the metrics screen uniquely demo-worthy.",
